reviews.text:
I don't think the environment here matches the price.

First of all, I think both the therapists are very skilled and they massaged me really well. But I really don't think the environment here is great.

First, we were assigned a room on the fourth floor, and I don't know if it hadn't been used for a long time, but it smelled really bad when we got in;

second, the room on the fourth floor was extremely hot, and it wasn't until we got up there that we saw the staff turn on the air conditioning, and it took about ten minutes for it to cool down;

third, the decoration on the fourth floor was terrible, the bathroom seemed to be missing half a piece of glass, and honestly, this price shouldn't come with such an environment;

last but not least, it's completely soundproof, I kept hearing all the noise from outside, as well as people singing.

Anyway, the two of us chose the 90-minute aroma for a total of 2700. The price is really not in line with the service and the environment here. I think it should only cost half that much, and even then that would still be all going to the two staff members.
